Date: Thu, 24 Sep 2026 16:48:02 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] Read the plan from Supabase instead of plan/schedule.json

The plan moved to Supabase on 2026-09-24 so it can be changed from any device
without editing a file or running a build. dashboard/build.py now fetches it
from a public read-only edge function and maps it onto the shape the rest of
the build already expected, so the 15-minute rebuild workflow picks up changes
with no other moving parts.

plan/block-targets.md is updated to match: Gorge Waterfalls 100K was dropped in
September 2026 for the Eugene Marathon, which leaves Block 3 without an end race,
the ladder without a 100K, and no backup Western States qualifier. All three are
stated rather than quietly dropped.

